# OFF rule (config.json). Reported on the WRITE of the index, not the access.
# hits: plain Calc (26), Inc before access inside a while (38), one-sided guard (50),
#       subrange-typed index (60), unguarded parameter = hint on the access (66), unanchorable fix (161)
index-possibly-out-of-range 26
index-possibly-out-of-range 38
index-possibly-out-of-range 50
index-possibly-out-of-range 60
index-possibly-out-of-range 66
index-possibly-out-of-range 161
# wrong evaluation order: A[i] is read before the i <= 8 conjunct (209)
index-possibly-out-of-range 209
# non-hits: for Low..High (74 75), for 0..Length-1 (83 84), while with Inc after (91 95 96),
#           both-sides if (105 107), early Exit (115 118), early raise (125 128),
#           dual use (136), literal index (137), string (146 147), guarded param (154)
